## Commits

| SHA | Subject |
|---|---|
| `f0f56df` | exp11 fix14 (RED): an arm root nobody can list reads as an arm with nothing in it |
| `bcd981c` | exp11 fix14 (GREEN): an arm is quiet only once it has been enumerated |
